      "content": "the \"small things\" feel insulting. i'm not a person who does small things. i was part of something big, and now i'm just a ghost haunting my own life. honestly, it feels more like a mercy to just stop fighting it. like, why keep dragging this around when there's nothing left to save anyway?",
